scroll_active = true
text = "[b]What this demo teaches[/b]
1. Sheet variables [code]s_score[/code]
2. Subsheet with params [code]p_amount[/code] + return [code]r_value[/code]
3. Pick / family (optional)
4. Multi-behavior on a node
5. Breakpoint + F8/F9 step debugger
6. Save / Load sheet state

[b]Setup (editor)[/b]
• Open this scene → FlowKit panel
• [b]File → Import Sheet JSON…[/b] → select
  [code]addons/flowkit/demos/full_loop/full_loop_sheet.json[/code]
• Select [code]Player[/code] → Inspector → Behaviors: add platformer or drift
• Run scene (F5). Press Space to award points via Call Subsheet.
• F4 debug overlay · set breakpoint on an event · F8/F9 to step

[b]Expected[/b]
• Score label updates from sheet var
• Debug log shows events / subsheet / return
"

